{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5e5a75a8daa87fabfbaf0a054633e4bdba6393789f86506584d458b0f12a310e","ja":"きっと魅力はあるはずだから","zh":"一定有着独特的魅力","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"433cf710b6dd221e4a50397f23d6f88afedc5b5cf129992b80518b44754249c4","ja":"ではまず、『ワンピース』側からの主張を\nお願いします。","zh":"那么首先，请“连衣裙”派\n陈述你们的主张。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bda25d743c7db3dfe332698881b47d8444bdae4d654fe11b46453e8847eec60c","ja":"そうね……ワンピースはかわいいのも、\n大人っぽいのもあって、デートにぴったりだと思うわ♪","zh":"是呢……连衣裙既有可爱的，\n也有成熟风格的，我觉得非常适合约会穿哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"875884f0c509c3086954033d42f1fc3e2d233ee5400dc51cbf0591f09a64e8b8","ja":"お気に入りのワンピースを着たら、幸せな気分にも\nなると思うの。紬ちゃんもそう思わない？","zh":"只要穿上心仪的连衣裙，就会觉得\n心情变得幸福起来呢。小紬不这么觉得吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"64ae8cf7e39e28349df2ed3b35de438898696d3cd08c7a5c3b4c942940b4988c","ja":"えっ？　う、うちはそんな、デートとか想像も……！\nこほん。大神さんのご意見はどうですか？","zh":"哎？我、我可从来没想过约会什么的……！\n咳咳。大神同学有什么想法吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"96c6e863366e3ff474cbcf309d8d7a553694c15e2866abefaa1e10fbb24dd2a4","ja":"たまきはね～……ワンピースって、\nすっごく特別なものって思うぞ！","zh":"环觉得呢～……连衣裙这种衣服，\n是非常特别的哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0e763ddd4f5bebe6811818bffb4afc26eb2f9057f249ab07316b3a93d328a829","ja":"たまきがワンピースを着てると、お姉さんに\n見えるんだって！　だからデートにピッタリだぞ！","zh":"听说环穿上连衣裙的时候，\n看起来就像个大姐姐呢！所以很适合去约会哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4c2af7273855f8fe8808bc13a118244516c47f17d9af815a0c27acd7e45257a0","ja":"パチパチパチパチ！","zh":"啪啪啪啪！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c5dde715961f644423bd4ee6c77a8988a72278d22cac2b3a413080dea21d7dce","ja":"観客席から、あたたかな拍手が送られています。","zh":"观众席送来了温暖的掌声。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"205e65b6b0a3bbf39915a9a515d5e4980cb815cc9f5b29d99ef9e0285bcae2a7","ja":"では、その……『学校ジャージ』側の\nご意見もよろしくお願いします！","zh":"那么，那个……也拜托各位发表\n“学校运动服”这边的意见了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9a3485a85f933ce911949ca8bcc5638681cbad5625eb623f468a12d803ebe3ec","ja":"ええっと、困ったな～……。\nうーん、うーん……あっ！","zh":"这个嘛，真难办啊～……\n唔——唔——……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"bf48ce301f0987228007b74b28207db1fc9d3802938216719848d638f98c4066","ja":"学校ジャージだと、在校生とか卒業生に親しみを\n持ってもらえて街を歩くのも楽しい……とか？","zh":"穿学校运动服的话，在校生或毕业生会觉得很亲切，\n走在街上也会很开心……之类的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f4ef934d2420a815d7c9d5cf95881d0fbf1a0a3950aa4e5a381948d0b9f9fd35","ja":"シーン……","zh":"静悄悄……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0433b22b811ba202849cc2c7fbfd2c80da81b1a9cdaba71f8c4fa32af83c0136","ja":"わあっ、ごめんまつり！\n今のはいらない意見だったかも！","zh":"哇啊，对不起茉莉！\n刚才那个意见可能多余了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"7f475a00eac8f4ad078c4203838213a0cd03bbdd16ee73801716d38f3cf10734","ja":"のーぷろぶれむ！なのです♪\nピンチをチャンスに変えるのですよ！","zh":"没问题！完全小菜一碟♪\n要把危机化为转机哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"36c58c740e39015e57e80ae88b760c5f2df0c704c18ef5527800f6a6e5b2b7aa","ja":"のり子ちゃんが言っていたように、学校ジャージは\nとても目立つのです。ですから……。","zh":"正如法子所说，学校的运动服\n十分显眼。因此……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"79baa412a1c321fb163ee1a666a664ef4b31c3b6700710bb96255c7306688a87","ja":"一生忘れられないデートが演出できちゃうのですよ♪\n何年たっても色褪せない素敵な思い出になるのです！","zh":"能打造出一场让人终生难忘的约会哦♪\n无论过去多少年，都将是一段不会褪色的美好回忆！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8dc353ded87e3ac2815b328a6319191d40eee72deffe0b7319f2bb899dfc0b0a","ja":"パチ……パチ……","zh":"啪……啪……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"23fbf34896b0477d601ca3fd6506582e297e510534da05152c668de837b65783","ja":"あっ……！\n困惑しながら、拍手をされている方が！","zh":"啊……！\n有人一脸困惑地在鼓掌！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"5dd0cae27a3234b1b03debe85c1fbd1daf18fc8194f8e4f25859b9eb7043c8d4","ja":"学校ジャージのデート、面白そうに聞こえちゃうわね。\n気を抜いてたら、流れを持っていかれちゃうかも？","zh":"穿学校运动服约会，听起来挺有意思的呢。\n要是不留神，说不定节奏就要被带跑了哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1057.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"97c963b746bd6b3628599650dd78d5456670165c03d260bf1244cc01de06914b","ja":"たまきたちだって、負けないぞ～！","zh":"环她们也是不会认输的哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
